@mgoin ,  I tried running **benchmarks/kernels/benchmark_moe.py** on H20 (with deepseek config) , and the data shows that there is no performance loss in the kernel. Regarding end-to-end performance, I didn't conduct a comprehensive test, but it seems that there is no noticeable performance loss.

